#! timeout 120
# Flat-level-surface lava top repro: a wall-bounded patch of uniform
# level-3 lava is perfectly flat below source height (solid corner
# contributors are skipped, so every corner lands on own_height).
# Those cells are BLOCK_COORDS_FLUID with v_flow_dir = 0 — the
# vertex shader must keep their top UVs unscaled. A bug applied the
# side-strip by-height v-scale to them, collapsing the *_FLOW tile
# to a thin sliver: stretched lines across the pool. Asserts pin the
# staging (level-3 cells survive ~216 lava ticks); screenshots are
# the visual check.
wait_idle 20 6000
fill 3 1 3 11 1 3 STONE
fill 3 1 11 11 1 11 STONE
fill 3 1 4 3 1 10 STONE
fill 11 1 4 11 1 10 STONE
setblock 4 1 4 LAVA 3
setblock 4 1 5 LAVA 3
setblock 4 1 6 LAVA 3
setblock 4 1 7 LAVA 3
setblock 4 1 8 LAVA 3
setblock 4 1 9 LAVA 3
setblock 4 1 10 LAVA 3
setblock 5 1 4 LAVA 3
setblock 5 1 5 LAVA 3
setblock 5 1 6 LAVA 3
setblock 5 1 7 LAVA 3
setblock 5 1 8 LAVA 3
setblock 5 1 9 LAVA 3
setblock 5 1 10 LAVA 3
setblock 6 1 4 LAVA 3
setblock 6 1 5 LAVA 3
setblock 6 1 6 LAVA 3
setblock 6 1 7 LAVA 3
setblock 6 1 8 LAVA 3
setblock 6 1 9 LAVA 3
setblock 6 1 10 LAVA 3
setblock 7 1 4 LAVA 3
setblock 7 1 5 LAVA 3
setblock 7 1 6 LAVA 3
setblock 7 1 7 LAVA 3
setblock 7 1 8 LAVA 3
setblock 7 1 9 LAVA 3
setblock 7 1 10 LAVA 3
setblock 8 1 4 LAVA 3
setblock 8 1 5 LAVA 3
setblock 8 1 6 LAVA 3
setblock 8 1 7 LAVA 3
setblock 8 1 8 LAVA 3
setblock 8 1 9 LAVA 3
setblock 8 1 10 LAVA 3
setblock 9 1 4 LAVA 3
setblock 9 1 5 LAVA 3
setblock 9 1 6 LAVA 3
setblock 9 1 7 LAVA 3
setblock 9 1 8 LAVA 3
setblock 9 1 9 LAVA 3
setblock 9 1 10 LAVA 3
setblock 10 1 4 LAVA 3
setblock 10 1 5 LAVA 3
setblock 10 1 6 LAVA 3
setblock 10 1 7 LAVA 3
setblock 10 1 8 LAVA 3
setblock 10 1 9 LAVA 3
setblock 10 1 10 LAVA 3
setblock 15 1 7 LAVA
wait_idle 20 6000
assert_block 4 1 4 LAVA
assert_block 7 1 7 LAVA
assert_block 10 1 10 LAVA
probe 7 1 7
wait 60
camera 7.5 12.0 7.5 0 89
wait 30
screenshot lava_flat_top
camera 7.5 4.5 -2.0 180 40
wait 30
screenshot lava_flat_angle
echo fluid_flat_lava_top done
